# Recon-Default Invariant — Stub

Full ladder + skeptic mechanism: Use the `cheap-recon-before-escalation` skill (on trigger).

## Invariant (one line)

∀ code-work intake — friction classed **feature/bug**, or todo seeded **sparse/early** (`density_triage` unset or `recon_pending`) — the **default front-half is recon** (axis-1 cost ladder; axis-2 skeptic on material) **before** implement.

## Trigger → action

| Condition | Action |
|---|---|
| Operator says "address friction N" where N is a feature/bug | Run recon front-half — Use the `cheap-recon-before-escalation` skill; ¬ jump to implement |
| Pickup a todo whose `density_triage` is unset or `recon_pending` | Run recon front-half before drafting implement spec |
| Material todo (`judgment_required`) without `skeptic_ratified` attestation | Axis-2 skeptic is binding — Use the `cheap-recon-before-escalation` skill §Axis-2 |
| `recon_waived="<reason>"` present on entity attrs | Waiver granted — skip axis-2 skeptic only; dense-spec / `files_expected` / acceptance checks still required |

## Exempt set (no recon required)

- Pure **assertion / observation** path (friction *logging* only, knowledge claims)
- `density_triage == "mechanical"` or `"trivial"` scope
- Todo already carries a **dense implement spec** with `files_expected` + `acceptance_criteria`

## Use the full skill when ANY trigger fires

Use the `cheap-recon-before-escalation` skill

Cross-refs: `friction-review_ws.mdc` (investigate→execute lane), `advisor-timing.mdc` (pause before first write), `reasoning-posture` + `frontier-reasoning-discipline` (paired — pin Question/OOS before merits, then steelman / calibrate on material judgment).
